  <h4 style="margin-top: 1em;">9.1.2 Units</h4>
  <p>Combo boxes in this file card show basic units for the actuator. Select the required unit for your application via the related combo box.</p>

  <h5 style="margin-top: 1em;">9.1.2.1 Torque / Force</h5>
  <p>Select either:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Nm (N)</li>
    <li>kN (kN)</li>
    <li>lbf</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Values in brackets refer to linear actuators.</p>

  <h5 style="margin-top: 1em;">9.1.2.2 Positioning Speed</h5>
  <p>For linear actuator select either:</p>
